mponents, and optoelectronics; and equipment, tools, and other electronic component products comprising various electromechanical, maintenance, repair and operation, and various design tools. Its products are used by small and medium-sized enterprises in the consumer electronics industry, Internet of Things, automotive electronics, and industry control segments. The company sells its products through its online platform. It also offers customs clearance, temporary warehousing, logistics, and shipping services. The company was formerly known as Horizon Business Intelligence Co., Limited and changed its name to ICZOOM Group Inc. in May 2018. ICZOOM Group Inc. was founded in 2012 and is headquartered in Shenzhen, the People's Republic of China."}}